{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10643020","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10643020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1064302001:0":{"text":"遠路はるばるお越しの皆さん！武器鍛造大会へようこそ！\n厳正なる審査の結果、エスペリア各地から集まった十六名の鍛造者が、<style=\"highlight\">第一ラウンド</style>に進出します！","source_cn":"各位远道而来的朋友！欢迎来到比赛现场！\\n经过严格的资...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CB18798A242522F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064302002:0":{"text":"そのルールとは――苛烈なノックアウト戦です！\n参加者の皆さんには一日の猶予が与えられ、<style=\"highlight\">公式素材</style>を使って、<style=\"highlight\">連発火薬銃</style>を製作していただきます！","source_cn":"他们将迎来严酷的考验——车轮战！\\n请听清规则！各位参...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2A27F47D54B5E0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064302003:0":{"text":"二十四時間後、審査員がその銃を用いて射撃を行い、貫通数の多い上位四名が次のラウンドへ進出となります！","source_cn":"一天后，评委们将使用参赛者制作的火铳，射击多重标靶。穿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9C0BAC47475A412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064302004:0":{"text":"では、ただ今より――武器鍛造大会を正式に開始します！","source_cn":"现在，我宣布——比赛，正式开始！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6887EBD9A51ADF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064302005:0":{"text":"大会開始の合図とともに、参加者たちは次々と自分の工房へと足を運び、時間との戦いになる鍛造作業に取り掛かった。","source_cn":"随着比赛开始，参赛者们纷纷起身走进自己的工坊，开始时间...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCEF16C4BF8DAFD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064302006:0":{"text":"えっ、今年の通過枠はたったの四人だけ？例年なら半分は通るのにね。","source_cn":"首轮竟然只有四个晋级名额，往年可都是晋级一半人呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EDC08C56F5100AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064302007:0":{"text":"まあ<style=\"highlight\">事前に課題は分かってたんだし、どうせ勝つのはドワーフだよ</style>。よそ者には悪いけど、これも地の利ってやつだ。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>反正提前知道考题了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEEE8D89E3983F4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064302008:0":{"text":"しーっ、声が大きい。誰かに聞かれたらどうするのよ……","source_cn":"嘘，小点声，别被其他人给听到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CF1DFD0F63CC1FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064302009:0":{"text":"アーーッ、もうムカつく！そんなのゼッタイに許さない！","source_cn":"啊啊啊——我生气了，我生气了！不允许，绝对不允许！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFDCFF60D495AF0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064302010:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064302011:0":{"text":"ちょっと、そのガラクタをいじる手を止めなさいヨ！アタシがムカついてるワケが気にならないの！？","source_cn":"喂，别弄你那些破铜烂铁了！你就一点不好奇我在说什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC706806A4B2F633E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064302012:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064302013:0":{"text":"さっきネ、誰かの会話が聞こえてきたんだけど……<style=\"highlight\">ドワーフの連中は、事前に第一ラウンドの内容を知らされてたんだって</style>！","source_cn":"我亲耳听到矮人闲聊，<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66506ECCDF2D94E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064302014:0":{"text":"そんなのズルよ！不公平にもほどがある！","source_cn":"这是作弊！不公平！他们自己定的规矩，自己都不遵守！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3490F67CDD7FEA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064302015:0":{"text":"何が地の利ヨ！アタシみたいに邪悪で、原則なんか気にしないカタストロフですらドン引きなんですけど！","source_cn":"连我这样邪恶、不讲原则的大恶魔都看不下去了，这些关系户...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CBF4A1CE9599872","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064302016:1":{"text":"それならアタシもセーセードードー、特大爆弾でブッ飛ばしてやるわヨ！","source_cn":"要不是比赛规则不允许，我一定要做一个堂堂正正的大炸弹，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20A4B053BF3FD54D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064302017:0":{"text":"正々堂々……？いえ、何でもありません。","source_cn":"呃……库露露大人，您想说的是史无前例吧……算了算了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x974F5015BFC81991","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064302018:0":{"text":"フンッ……\nとにかくルールを守らない連中には、痛い目を見せなきゃダメなの！","source_cn":"史无前例，史上第一，史……呃……\\n总之，一定要让这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28F69F193F7E4C78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064302019:0":{"text":"鉄クズ頭も、なんか言ったらどうなのヨ！まさか、アタシを疑ってんじゃないでしょうネ！？","source_cn":"啊喂，铁块头，你一直不说话是什么意思！难道你不相信我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E5F8361259EA224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064302020:0":{"text":"人間の規則、無価値。\nカタストロフ、火力で、すべて消し去る。","source_cn":"人类规则，无用。\\n恶魔，用火力，湮灭一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDE2B375F945ACCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","doc