_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064302031:0":{"text":"その時、耳をつんざくような爆発音が夜空を切り裂き、火光と濃煙が辺りに広がった……ドワーフたちは混乱に陥り、悲鳴や叫び声が至る所で上がっている……","source_cn":"忽然，震耳欲聋的爆炸声撕裂夜空，火光与浓烟弥漫……矮人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x702A15DE5798641B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064302032:0":{"text":"どういうことだよ！？なんでこんな大爆発が起きてんのさ！","source_cn":"怎么回事？！怎么会有这么剧烈的爆炸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1DEB3EBE4116293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064302033:0":{"text":"ラーヂ！すぐに大会の中止を宣言するんだ！それから全員を避難させろ！","source_cn":"拉齐，多带几个人，立刻宣布比赛中止，组织所有人撤离深岩村。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x827E01FFE5B5430D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064302034:0":{"text":"で、でも、まだ第一ラウンドが始まったばかりで……ここで中止なんかしたら、今までの投資が全部ムダになる！","source_cn":"可、可是这才到第一场比赛，要是就这么停了，之前的投入可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C5ABFB214ABEA64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064302035:0":{"text":"安全が最優先だ！大会なんかいつでもやり直せるけど、村が吹っ飛んだら終わりだろ！急いで！","source_cn":"安全第一！比赛还能再办，村子毁了就什么都没了！快去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68AA3B0D7D88D919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fema